 ```
 
+### Downloads
+`/mods/:userSlug/:modSlug/download/:version` asks the API (via `API_URL`, or `PUBLIC_API_URL`) with
+`redirect: "manual"`, forwarding the client IP (`CF-Connecting-IP`, else the first `X-Forwarded-For` hop)
+and user agent, and returns the API's `302` to the file on R2 unchanged. File bytes never pass through
+the frontend; `404` and `410` errors keep their status code.
+
 To setup the project run:
 
 ```bash
